"characterName":"レイ・アンダー","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c125802"},"originalCharacterName":"レイ・アンダー","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"He's a fashion model from the same office as Raul. A naturally gifted model who can maintain his beauty without the need for skin care or dietary restrictions. He values the compatibility of his skeletal structure. His manager often gets angry with him for speaking to people in an informal tone, regardless of age or seniority, but he has no intention of fixing it (Raul doesn't mind)."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c125802"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fa/fa74e8845ed600200a6e768fa5afed6c54a96267c1ad5106f54a568e8fdfbc24.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0c/0c5f17c221bc06928275ac41ee2d25b90edacee8550a2ff0ced53f88a2178a2e.webp","width":190,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"小林 千晃","creatorId":"vndb:s25083","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s25083","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s25083","name":"小林 千晃","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:90617","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c125803","characterName":"イーライ・オマール","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c125803"},"originalCharacterName":"イーライ・オマール","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"He is the young Vice President of Omar Holdings, headquartered in Lyon, France. He is responsible for the newly-made artificial island in Los York, called \"D'Amour Paradis\" (Paradise of Love). In order to further expand his business, he sets his sights on Cupid Corporation."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c125803"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/71/71ca2a6b31309a3e88cefed8dfab743231af8dbfe1f8208c0b6d7b92745f0ae3.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0e/0eb0a30f7d2133e91a94d9cf1f09dc927ab6d5b240d9a11c29fe848d4da82547.webp","width":190,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"笠間 淳","creatorId":"vndb:s19109","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s19109","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s19109","name":"笠間 淳","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:90614","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c89445","characterName":"リネット・ミラー","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c89445"},"originalCharacterName":"リネット・ミラー","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A top bridal adviser for \"Cupid Corporation\" and the real goddess of love, Cupid."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her father, the God known as Mars, had a disagreement on her method of work (how to use cupid arrows). This led into a quarrel with her father."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"In order to prove her beliefs, with the help of her aunt, the goddess Minerva, this ambitious goddess descended to the human world."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Recently her current obsession is to use the small electric current that flows between the horns of her divine creature called “Chi-chan” (who came along with her from the divine world she resided in) as a massage machine."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c89445"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fc/fcb891852b70c191575c5cc999d8db289521c67322481933517fceac0b160b3c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2c/2c99ddece239955afd2ca34349bfb96f41a9707c709b1414042cf14242000692.webp","width":212,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c89446","characterName":"ギル・ラヴクラフト","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c89446"},"originalCharacterName":"ギル・ラヴクラフト","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"24"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"716"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"o"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"178"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A freelance editor who is in charge of editing magazines, books, and news sites. 2 years ago, in order to get over his heartbreak feeling, he joined the Cupid Corporation. However, because he compared everything to his unrequited love, he became a troublesome member of Parasite5."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"His unrequited love was back in his freshman university days and the heroine who became his roommate. He dedicated himself to supporting her who was ignorant of the world (because she had just come to the human world) and came to fell for her. But for him whose feelings went unnoticed, this led to his heartbreak and decision to no longer be roommates."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"This time he is reunited with the heroine as his own adviser and so the gears of love that stopped before have started to move again."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c89446"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/53/53531ceb9d6e320d18f645241d031ad6ba32954751214bf0bb82241be08738f3.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/55/55934e24e6f1fddf31eb46ce4884153a1ea68103dff79b87f80f1124f5e9eaf4.webp","width":212,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"木村 良平","creatorId":"vndb:s382","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s382","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s382","name":"木村 良平","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:90604","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c89447","characterName":"シェルビー・スネイル","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c89447"},"originalCharacterName":"シェルビー・スネイル","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"32"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"907"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"a"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"185"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The founder and president of Cupid Corporation. Although he’s widely known for being a devoted husband, he’s actually single."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"For consistency purposes, he decides to get married as soon as possible and behind-the-scenes (with wishes to stay anonymous and have a proxy marriage by the secretary) within the company. He offered a proposition for the heroine who boldly stated she wanted a promotion."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"While always looking to improve, he has a stoic nature that gives him an advantage in a high rank position. In addition to adapting to his work-oriented lifestyle, he has a side of him that believes that feelings of love are illogical."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c89447"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/46/46aa0f12385ea87d64b11870b4df2b7dd03faf9bf95adc148145b0e9d2036c53.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fe/fe52c58ce8e7b8bd2d40c0647692f650cc592613d10bfcfc27fe3c042da6e371.webp","width":212,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"KENN","creatorId":"vndb:s372","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s372","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s372","name":"KENN","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:90603","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c89448","characterName":"ラウル・アコニット","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c89448"},"originalCharacterName":"ラウル・アコニット","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"21"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"110"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"b"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"183"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A movie star who is very popular with the ladies. Known for his good looks and has become a hit in his action movie roles."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"With the decision to appear in his first romance films, his company was worried with whether or not he could make his acting look “real”, so he joined the Cupid Corporation in order to study love."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"After an experience of being saved by a God, he became immersed in mythological research which has become his hobby and now i